            </note>
            <note corresp="#d153-f2" n="2" xml:id="d153-f2-content">
                <p>
                    Carter submitted Reorganization Plan No.
                    2 of 1978 to Congress on May 23. See <hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers:
                            Carter</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">1978</hi>, Book I, pp. 953–959.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d153-f3" n="3" xml:id="d153-f3-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d152-f4">footnote 4, Document 152</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d153-f4" n="4" xml:id="d153-f4-content">
                <p>Wayne G. Granquist.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d153-f5" n="5" xml:id="d153-f5-content">
                <p>
                    E.O. 11491, “Employee-Management Relations in
                    the Federal Service,” was signed on October 29, 1969.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d153-f6" n="6" xml:id="d153-f6-content">
                <p>Reference to Title VII, “Federal Service Labor-Management Relations,” of the
                    proposed Civil Service Reform Act.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
